  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In Varginha, a town in Brazil where strange beings were reportedly seen in 1996, the empty lot where they appeared is said to still be there today, fenced off but still visited by people. A surgeon named Italo Venturelli mentions this on Jesse Michels' show, passing on what he has been told. He adds that there is a project to research the spot, which would matter if the beings were real."
